    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; weight steady</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Catheter draining well; no pain or blood</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lightheadedness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Calm and clear about his wishes; no low mood</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
